  "lines": [
   {
    "id": "O60-L01",
    "section": "Verse 1",
    "text": "Lumpy months? It was never where your clients came from,",
    "start": 0.92,
    "end": 3.59
   },
   {
    "id": "O60-L02",
    "section": "Verse 1",
    "text": "take Maya, a consultant: referrals filled her March,",
    "start": 3.59,
    "end": 6.09
   },
   {
    "id": "O60-L03",
    "section": "Verse 1",
    "text": "then April went quiet, she'd been too busy in March",
    "start": 6.09,
    "end": 8.55
   },
   {
    "id": "O60-L04",
    "section": "Verse 1",
    "text": "to look for April's clients while the work was coming in.",
    "start": 8.55,
    "end": 10.8
   },
   {
    "id": "O60-L05",
    "section": "Verse 1",
    "text": "So she tried some fixes: cold email, LinkedIn,",
    "start": 10.8,
    "end": 13.55
   },
   {
    "id": "O60-L06",
    "section": "Verse 1",
    "text": "a coach and then some ads, and each held a month, then came loose.",
    "start": 13.55,
    "end": 16.33
   },
   {
    "id": "O60-L07",
    "section": "Spoken",
    "text": "A friend who'd had lumpy months too asked her: \"Are your fixes connected?\"",
    "start": 17.26,
    "end": 20.79
   },
   {
    "id": "O60-L08",
    "section": "Pre-chorus",
    "text": "They weren't: just scraps, each one patched on alone,",
    "start": 21.5,
    "end": 23.47
   },
   {
    "id": "O60-L09",
    "section": "Chorus",
    "text": "that's patchwork marketing: no scrap is sewn to the next.",
    "start": 23.87,
    "end": 29.18
   },
   {
    "id": "O60-L10",
    "section": "Chorus",
    "text": "Steady months don't need one more scrap sewn on,",
    "start": 29.18,
    "end": 32.12
   },
   {
    "id": "O60-L11",
    "section": "Chorus",
    "text": "just one cloth to cut every piece from.",
    "start": 32.12,
    "end": 34.53
   },
   {
    "id": "O60-L12",
    "section": "Verse 2",
    "text": "That cloth is the words her buyers use for their problem:",
    "start": 34.74,
    "end": 37.25
   },
   {
    "id": "O60-L13",
    "section": "Verse 2",
    "text": "her offer came from those words, her posts came from that offer,",
    "start": 37.25,
    "end": 39.75
   },
   {
    "id": "O60-L14",
    "section": "Verse 2",
    "text": "and ads went last, only on the posts that worked,",
    "start": 39.75,
    "end": 42.08
   },
   {
    "id": "O60-L15",
    "section": "Verse 2",
    "text": "so those posts kept finding buyers while she was busy.",
    "start": 42.08,
    "end": 44.74
   },
   {
    "id": "O60-L16",
    "section": "Outro",
    "text": "Next April wasn't as full as March, but nothing came loose.",
    "start": 45.02,
    "end": 49.52
   },
   {
    "id": "O60-L17",
    "section": "Outro",
    "text": "No more patchwork marketing, no scrap sewn on alone.",
    "start": 49.52,
    "end": 54.01
   },
   {
    "id": "O60-L18",
    "section": "Spoken",
    "text": "Follow for part two: where to find your buyers' words.",
    "start": 55.14,
    "end": 58.66
   }
  ],
